<title>USA: Morgan Stanley Q3 shr buybacks total $42 mln.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley Q3 shr buybacks total $42 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Group Inc said on Wednesday it repurchased $42 million of its common stock in the third quarter, bringing total repurchases for the first three quarters of its fiscal year to $507 million.</p>
<p>The company, which repurchased $103 million of stock during all of 1995, said it has about $258 million remaining under its existing buyback authorization.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
